{
  "note": "Recorded in order from the reference FastAPI server on an ephemeral port, in dev_token mode, with the default configuration and its session's worker actually attached. A probe may quote an earlier one with ${id.path}. Values that differ between runs are '<volatile>'; 'body_keys' is the key set of a body that was masked whole.",
